---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Join" description="DeadMTL — open access planned. Free to join when the server launches. Read the rules before connecting.">

<section class="term-hero" style="padding-block: clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem);">
  <div class="th__inner">
    <div class="th__eyebrow">Open Access // Season 0</div>
    <div class="th__headline" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem,5vw,3.5rem);">Join When Online</div>
    <p class="th__body">
      DeadMTL is planned as a free, open Project Zomboid survival server.
      No application. No private approval process.
      When the server launches, players will be able to connect directly.
    </p>
    <div class="th__cta">
      <a href="/rules/" class="term-btn term-btn--teal">Read the Rules &rsaquo;</a>
      <a href="/construction/" class="term-btn term-btn--amber">Season 0 Status &rsaquo;</a>
      <a href="/" class="term-btn term-btn--ghost">&larr; Home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 840px;">

    <div class="term-panel" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <div class="term-header">
        <span class="th__tag th__tag--amber">[ STATUS ]</span>
        <span class="th__rule"></span>
        <span class="th__info">Server Pending</span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;">
        <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.78rem;">
          {[
            ['Server Address', 'Not public yet'],
            ['Port',           '16261 (default PZ)'],
            ['Access',         'OPEN PLANNED'],
            ['Discord',        'Pending'],
            ['Season 0',       'Setup'],
          ].map(([field, val]) => (
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
              <td style="padding:0.55rem 0.9rem; color:var(--text-muted); width:40%;">{field}</td>
              <td style="padding:0.55rem 0.9rem; color:var(--cream);">{val}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="term-panel" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <div class="term-header">
        <span class="th__tag">Open Access</span>
        <span class="th__rule"></span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--text-dim); line-height:1.75;">
        <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
          DeadMTL is planned as a free, open server.
          No whitelist application. No private approval process.
          When the server opens, players will be able to join directly, read the rules, and enter the first survival season.
        </p>
        <p>
          Free to join does not mean free to ruin.
          DeadMTL is built around atmosphere, cooperation, survival pressure, and community standards.
          Griefing and chaos-for-chaos behavior will not define the server.
          Rules are enforced. Bans apply.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="term-panel" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <div class="term-header">
        <span class="th__tag">How It Will Work</span>
        <span class="th__rule"></span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;">
        <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--text-dim); line-height:1.75;">
          <div style="margin-bottom:0.6rem; padding-left:2.5rem; position:relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);font-size:0.65rem;">[01]</span>Read the server rules. They apply from the first connection.</div>
          <div style="margin-bottom:0.6rem; padding-left:2.5rem; position:relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);font-size:0.65rem;">[02]</span>Join the DeadMTL Discord when it opens — link will be posted here.</div>
          <div style="margin-bottom:0.6rem; padding-left:2.5rem; position:relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);font-size:0.65rem;">[03]</span>When the server is live, connect using the posted server address and port.</div>
          <div style="padding-left:2.5rem; position:relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);font-size:0.65rem;">[04]</span>Participate in Season 0. Follow the rules. Help build the community.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="term-panel">
      <div class="term-header">
        <span class="th__tag">Discord</span>
        <span class="th__rule"></span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--text-dim); line-height:1.65;">
        A Discord server will be created and linked here before Season 0 launches.
        There is no invite yet. Do not join any server claiming to be the official
        DeadMTL Discord — this site is the only source of truth.
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

</Base>
